# Name: Rose ruffle strip
# Use: Flat ruffled strip, rolled by hand into a rose
# Machine support: foundation chain runs now; SC and DC rows need row hardware
# Assembly: roll the strip from one end and stitch the base
CH 61
TURN
SC 60
TURN
DC 120 # two DC in each stitch makes the ruffle
TURN
SC 120
PAUSE Roll the strip from one end and stitch the base
